{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52285","headline":"诗（幷序） 四十六 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 四十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怨家煞人贼，即是短命子。\n生儿拟替翁，长大抛我死。\n债主蹔过来，徵我夫妻泪。\n父母眼乾枯，良由我忆你。\n好去更莫来，门前有煞鬼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}